      { question: "Is ITHRA free to visit?", answer: "The ITHRA grounds and library are free. The Museum has entry fees that vary by exhibition. The Energy Exhibit is an interactive paid attraction. Check ithra.com for current pricing before visiting." },
      { question: "Do I need a car in the Eastern Province?", answer: "Yes — the three cities (Dammam, Khobar, Dhahran) are 15–30km apart with no practical public transport. A pre-booked private taxi is the most convenient solution for airport transfers and intercity moves." }
