      { question: "What are the best restaurants in Al Khobar?", answer: "The Khobar Corniche area has excellent seafood restaurants. Al-Hamra district has the highest concentration of international and Lebanese restaurants. The Mall of Dhahran (10km from Khobar) has extensive dining options." }
